&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2XCH4fnCx3Mni8K8mYe5-FXlOJ2SYBRGl5vP2-r7OLFg&oe=69E635E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1314477467235763", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1314477470569096_7800708190831145047_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VMtIzOaW_dwQ7kNvwES1YR2&_nc_oc=AdqGphmDkxCqWUvr5gs5oP49mF38SkyTlQn74pcXcjUoME47emfGAxXjKn8DRQ5ODFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1HMvyEk3FL2WnhwdrjHL2dNxB1uWyR9tA1PUjNroybIw&oe=69E62457"}, "display_name": "I Am Mouse : Adventure Simulator", "keywords": ["iam", "mouse", "simulator", "adventure", "iammouse"], "long_description": "**Welcome to I Am Mouse: Your Tiny Adventure Awaits!**\n\n**Pick Your Adventure, Little Mouse!**\n\nChoose from the House, Office, or Space and dive straight into exciting challenges and surprises! Each world has a new adventure waiting for you!\n\n{1159542949524800}\n\n**Cheese Chase: Snatch the Snack!**\nOutsmart RC cars and drones to collect the most cheese in this thrilling, high-speed adventure!\n\n\n{745547554751341}\n\n**Aliens on the Loose? Send in the Mouse!**\n\nJoin the mouse on a galactic adventure, armed with a space gun to blast those pesky aliens!\n\n\n\n{10042326845876356}", "short_description": "Experience life as a tiny explorer in I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator, a fun and family-friendly VR adventure! Scurry through a house, office, and space station as a curious mouse. Collect cheese, solve small tasks, and discover the world from a whole new perspective. Three interactive maps, tons of surprises, and all the charm of a whiskered hero\u2014your squeaky VR journey starts now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "